// Replace the small choir with trumpet/violin thematic sections and horn/trombone inner voices; cello and contrabass separate the written bass octaves. Timpani and sparse cymbals mark formal arrivals instead of a continuous snare backbeat. Existing melody pitches/onsets, written ties/rests, tempo, meter and excerpt are retained. New percussion and selected support layers are this site's independent orchestration; GM1, CC7=100.
